; Built as an executable, not a library of kind ppx_rewriter: dune's `pps`
; wants a ppxlib driver and refuses a plain Ast_mapper rewriter. The -ppx
; protocol needs only a program, which is what Ast_mapper.run_main gives.
(executable
 (name demo_ppx)
 (modes byte_complete)
 (libraries compiler-libs.common))
